---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/legal-layout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Contact & Support" description="Get in touch with the DoctorConverter team for support, bug reports, feedback and partnership requests.">
  <p>Questions, bug reports, feature ideas or partnership requests: we would love to hear from you.</p>
  <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text">Email support</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-soft">For technical help, bug reports or general questions:</p>
      <a href="mailto:destek@doctorconverter.com" class="mt-4 inline-block font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">destek@doctorconverter.com</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text">Response time</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-soft">The tools are available around the clock. We aim to answer emails within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mt-12">Check the FAQ first</h2>
  <p>Many answers are in the <a href="/en/#faq" class="text-accent underline font-medium">frequently asked questions</a> on the home page.</p>
</LegalLayout>
